Hence, the appeal merits consideration, in the result, the following:
ORDER i) Appeal is allowed-in-part;
ii) Impugned judgment and award is modified;
iii) Petitioner is entitled to enhanced compensation of Rs.56,000/- with interest @
6% p.a. from the date of petition till the date of deposit.
NC: 2024:KHC:32440 MFA No 3393 of 2016 iv) The BMTC shall satisfy the award within eight weeks from the date of receipt of certified copy of the judgment.

